WirePlumber
===========

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pipewire/wireplumber.git
tag    = 0.5.19
commit = 4ab992fa2931ae2b17ef73508b1370030b7878c3
date   = 2026-10-30

PipeWire's session manager. tools/desktop/build-pipewire.sh builds this
revision (GitLab's archive of the tag, identical to the submodule, checked
by SHA-256) with tools/desktop/patches/wireplumber-dragonfly.txt
(lwp_gettid for gettid) against DPorts' lua54 and glib, after PipeWire,
and installs it in /System/Library/PipeWire (docs/desktop-pipewire.md).
Keep build output outside the submodule; when upgrading, update the tag
and checksum in build-pipewire.sh too.

License: see LICENSE and individual file notices. Complete the file-level
license and provenance review before distribution.

When upgrading, review its Lua scripts and configuration, PipeWire
version requirements and the desktop audio check.
